---
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Guilherme Sousa</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-black text-neutral-400 antialised">
		<main class="mx-auto max-w-screen-md py-12 sm:py-24 px-6">
			<div>
				<h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl text-neutral-100">Hi.</h1>
				<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-bold">인사</span>
			</div>

			<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl/normal mt-2 sm:mt-4">
				I’m a 
				<span class="text-neutral-100">
					Software Developer from Brazil.
				</span>
				I'm currently working on 
				<span class="text-neutral-100">
					LTA Fantasy @ Fracassi Tech.
				</span>
				I enjoy human-machine interactions,
				language learning, broken {"<"}<span class="text-neutral-100">div</span>{">"}
				tags and aha moments. I still want to venture in
				<span class="text-neutral-100">
					Broadcast Development</span>,
				by the way.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8">
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-100">Work</h2>
				<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-bold">업무 경험</span>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-2 sm:mt-4">
				<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-100">Fracassi Tech
					<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700">2025 - Ongoing</span>
				</h3>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-2">
				After leaving Mais Esports, I joined 
					<a href="#" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
						Fracassi Tech</a> to help building 
					<a href="https://ltafantasy.com/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
						LTA Fantasy</a>, commissioned by <span class="text-neutral-100">Riot Games</span>.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-4">
				<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-100">Mais Esports
					<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700">2020 - 2025</span>
				</h3>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-2">
					I started my career as a developer on
					<a href="https://maisesports.com.br/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
						Mais Esports,
					</a>
					the biggest Esports portal in Brazil. I've managed to work on different projects like 
					<a href="https://maisesports.com.br/especiais/matilha-ontem-e-sempre-titan-lol/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">special storytelling articles</a>,
					<a href="https://maisesports.com.br/bolao/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">prediction minigames</a>,
					<a href="https://maisesports.com.br/torneios/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">tournament coverages</a>,
					<a href="https://maisesports.com.br/stories/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">our own Web Stories solution,</a> and even doing <span class="text-neutral-100">Korean review</a>.
				</p>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-2">
				<span class="text-neutral-100 inline-block">Stack used:</span> React.js, Next.js, Strapi CMS, GraphQL, Styled Components, Tailwind CSS, AMP WebStories, Express, Typescript, Python, Redis, BetterStack, PandaScore, AWS, Heroku.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-4">
				<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-100">Freelancer
					<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700">2020 - Ongoing</span>
				</h3>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-2">
				I started my development career as a freelancer, and I still do some projects on my spare time.
				I collaborated with companies and personal brands like
				<a href="https://ltafantasy.com" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
					Fracassi Tech</a>, <a href="https://nicehousebr.com" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">Nice House</a>
					and <a href="https://ruanpdias.com/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
						Ruan P. Dias</a>.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-4">
				<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-100">Personal
				</h3>

				<p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-2">
					This is a LONG list:
					<ul class="mt-2 flex flex-col gap-y-2">
						<li>
							<span class="text-neutral-100 underline">Correio Anônimo:</span> Was a free and anonymous service that let users send messages to Twitter users. It reached 10K users and more than 30K messages sent, but it was shut down back in 2022.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://github.com/guilherssousa/learning-c/tree/main/projects/lispy" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">lispy:</a> A Lisp implementation written in C based on the "Build your on Lisp" book.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://github.com/guilherssousa/mew-machine" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">Mew Machine:</a> I did a mock of a 90's machine made for gifting the 151th Pokémon to kids back in the day.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7099558659986194432/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">An actual Pokédex:</a> A prototype that can read your game save files and track your Pokédex progress.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://sorting.guilherssousa.dev/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">Sorting Visualizer:</a> A Svelte project that lets you visualize step-by-step sorting using different algorithms.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://as-bump.vercel.app/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">as-bump:</a> A small website that lets you create bumper images following Adult Swim looks.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://github.com/guilherssousa/chip-8" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">chip-8:</a> A Chip-8 emulator written in Golang.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://github.com/guilherssousa/bfg" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">bfg:</a> A brainfuck interpreter written in Golang.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://vsc2wt.guilherssousa.dev/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">vsc2wt:</a> A tool that converts VS Code themes to Windows Terminal color schemes.
						</li>
						<li>
							<a href="https://hookpedia.vercel.app/" target="_href" class="text-neutral-100 underline">Hookpedia:</a> A PT/BR version of useHooks.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8">
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-100">Contact</h2>
				<span class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-bold">연락</span>
			</div>

			<p class="text-base sm:text-xl/normal mt-4">
			Want to get in contact? Please send an email to 
				<a href="mailto:guilherme@fracassi.tech" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
					guilherme@fracassi.tech</a> for company work related inquires. Or, if you want to talk about doing a project together, email me at
				<a href="mailto:guilherssousadev.contato@gmail.com" class="text-neutral-100 underline">
					guilherssousadev.contato@gmail.com</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
